# キー配列 (design 11.15), for tools/ui_run.py: a text given the keys, then the
# accessory opened from its program in front of it (its window at 160,200, its work
# area at 166,228; a key of the Japanese keyboard's row r whose left edge is q
# quarter-keys from the corner at 174+10q, 295+40r), letters typed into the text
# on the picture with the text keeping the keys, the menu of the second button shown
# and each of its choices made, a key given another and kept and given back with
# the panel under the keyboard, the pop-ups and the switch of the panel along the
# top worked, and closed. The menu opens with the item last chosen under the pointer, so its rows
# move as the steps go: 閉じる, then 20 lower after the line 英字配列, かな配列,
# キーボードの形, 表示, then 20 lower after the line 付け替え, 付け替えをやめる,
# 付け替えをすべて元に戻す; a submenu opens to the right with its first item level
# with the row that opened it.
click 950 600
wait 300
open 01a0d8c4-52e8-7b19-9c2a-3d4e5f6a7b84
expect keymap: ready latin 0 kana 0 map 0
wait 800
win キー配列
shot km_open
# Shift on the picture for the next key, then T e s t
click 219 434
expect keymap: latch 2
click 414 354
expect keymap: typed 17 mods 2
click 334 354
expect keymap: typed 08 mods 0
click 304 394
expect keymap: typed 16 mods 0
click 414 354
expect keymap: typed 17 mods 0
wait 500
shot km_typed
# the keyboard's own left Shift held: lit on the picture, the letters capitals, the text keeping the keys
keydown E1 02
wait 400
shot km_held
keyup E1
wait 300
# the menu of the second button, 閉じる under the pointer; 英字配列 > Dvorak
click 466 278 1
wait 600
shot km_menu
move 470 319
wait 150
move 600 319
wait 400
move 700 319
wait 150
shot km_menu_latin
move 700 339
wait 150
click 700 339
expect keymap: latin 1
wait 300
shot km_dvorak
# かな配列 > TRONかな配列 (英字配列 under the pointer)
click 466 278 1
wait 600
move 470 299
wait 150
move 600 299
wait 400
move 700 299
wait 150
move 700 319
wait 150
click 700 319
expect keymap: kana 1
# キーボードの形 > TRON (かな配列 under the pointer)
click 466 278 1
wait 600
move 470 299
wait 150
move 600 299
wait 400
move 700 299
wait 150
move 700 339
wait 150
click 700 339
expect keymap: shape 2
# 表示 > かな (キーボードの形 under the pointer), the submenu shown with its mark
click 466 278 1
wait 600
move 470 299
wait 150
move 600 299
wait 400
move 700 299
wait 150
shot km_menu_view
move 700 319
wait 150
click 700 319
expect keymap: view kana
wait 300
shot km_tron_kana
# 付け替え (表示 under the pointer): 英語 (CapsLock) made 命令 (the left Ctrl)
click 466 278 1
wait 600
move 470 319
wait 150
click 470 319
expect keymap: pick on
click 412 476
expect keymap: pick from 39
click 232 410
expect keymap: map 39 to e0
wait 300
shot km_mapped
# 閉じる (付け替え under the pointer), then opened again: the layouts and the key given another kept
click 466 278 1
wait 600
move 470 139
wait 150
click 470 139
expect keymap: closed
wait 500
open 01a0d8c4-52e8-7b19-9c2a-3d4e5f6a7b84
expect keymap: ready latin 1 kana 1 map 1
wait 800
shot km_again
click 466 278 1
wait 600
shot km_menu_again
move 470 279
wait 150
key 29
wait 300
# the panel under the keyboard: the key given another chosen in its list, given back with 〈元に戻す〉
click 300 539
wait 300
click 716 539
expect keymap: map 39 back
wait 300
shot km_reset
# the switch 付け替え on the panel along the top: on, then off
click 388 279
expect keymap: pick on
click 388 279
expect keymap: pick off
# the pop-ups, each list opening with what is chosen under the pointer: the latin
# layout back to the keys as written, the kana to 親指シフト and back to JIS かな
click 300 247
wait 600
click 300 226
expect keymap: latin 0
click 540 247
wait 600
click 540 268
expect keymap: kana 2
click 540 247
wait 600
click 540 205
expect keymap: kana 0
wait 300
shot km_buttons
# 閉じる, under the pointer as the menu opens
click 466 278 1
wait 600
move 470 279
wait 150
click 470 279
wait 800
shot km_closed
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
